  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting consultancy costs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD to pay for up to 10 consultancy days in August plus flight and accommodation in Lome for consultant to travel to Lome w/s 8 August for 3-5 days for work with Management team, the Finance Team  and the Treasurer. Further consultancy days to be discussed in preparation for partner meeting in late October, dependent on outcome of the meetings in Lome. 
The visit took place in August/September (10 days), and in October (12 days).
Additional approval for Capacity Strengthening coaching for a member of Caritas Africa staff.</narrative>
  </description>
